Leaving the chest untouched is allowed. Clue numbers around an egg count it as a Feast, so the tell is numbers that 'don't add up'." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;size=14;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="740" width="320" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="6 - Floor Result &amp; Run Result" id="page6"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="Page 6 - Floor Result (between floors) &amp; Run Result (run end)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="Player descends the stairs tile&lt;br&gt;(boss floor: after boss killed - empty floor: found it)" style="shape=offPageConnector;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;size=0.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="300" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="Floor Result (full page - 'regroup', not celebration)&lt;br&gt;Closing: Feast killed by tier, Fath, ingredients, HP lost; leftover Curse Gauge wasted&lt;br&gt;Curse Gauge reset (gauge only); curses held + In-run Threat + Feast ATK/HP multiplier carry on&lt;br&gt;Quest card: checklist + special-request status (order spoiled?)&lt;br&gt;Build (HP/STA/equipment/perks/curses/meals); resources&lt;br&gt;Next floor: boss or empty, Floor Variant + native curse (must be shown before descending)&lt;br&gt;[Cook] [Manage Equipment] [Descend] (primary) [Extract] (unlocked from main quest 2)" style="rounded=1;white