ariant&lt;br&gt;(defeat: floor died on + Feast that killed you)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="515" width="260" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="Phase 2 - Payout Ledger (line by line)&lt;br&gt;Special Ingredients 0/100/300/500 coin&lt;br&gt;Fath left x10 (defeat: forfeited, greyed)&lt;br&gt;x Pre-run Threat multiplier (x1.0 during main quest)&lt;br&gt;+ bonus coin from special requests (success only, not multiplied)&lt;br&gt;unused ingredients shown as wasted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="515" width="260" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="Phase 3 - Meta progress&lt;br&gt;vault: Special Ingredients that entered the vault (BossThreatRecord) as a bonus line&lt;br&gt;main quest: unlock (Floor Variant / recipe / character)&lt;br&gt;Daily Board: progress bar to next unlock" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="515" width="260" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="41" value="Phase 4 - Journey log (collapsible)&lt;br&gt;equipment + tier, perks, contract curses,&lt;br&gt;curses accepted, Feast by tier, meals, tiles, time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="680" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="42" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="32" target="38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="43" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;