 (Page 2)" style="shape=offPageConnector;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;size=0.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="810" width="240" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="51" value="[Run Again]&lt;br&gt;main quest: same card&lt;br&gt;Daily Board: card lost on death -&gt; board refreshes (Page 2)" style="shape=offPageConnector;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;size=0.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="805" width="280" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="52" value="primary: success / extract" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="48" target="50"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="53" value="primary: defeat" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="48" target="51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="835" y="910"/><mxPoint x="1440" y="910"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="54" value="Never show in any Result screen: EXP, Level, Coin while in dungeon (UX Screens sec. 0)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;size=14;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="60" width="460" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="55" value="Floor clear = stairs (GDD 2026-09-17). Boss floor: stairs unlock when the boss dies. Empty floor (smaller grid, same variant as the next boss floor): find the hidden stairs. Extract exists only here - there is no exit on the grid." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff9c4;s